+- Kronos-base remains a cloud-side forecast/confirmation layer only.
+- AI Institutional deployment profile uses default Kronos weight 20% and hard cap 25%.
+- Independent institutional risk engine remains final authority.
+- Missing, stale, conflicting or low-confidence intelligence resolves to NO TRADE.
+- Kronos is prohibited from the HFT hot path.
+- Existing V56 themes, broker catalogue, TradingView behavior and locked visual structure remain unchanged except three source-linked Kronos rows inside the existing Market Analysis section.
+- Upstream Kronos source is pinned to commit `67b630e67f6a18c9e9be918d9b4337c960db1e9a`.
+- Public model: `NeoQuasar/Kronos-base`.
+- Public tokenizer: `NeoQuasar/Kronos-Tokenizer-base`.
+- Kronos-large is not included.
